{"server":"en","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_st03","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_st03","title":"Trekking Upon Terra","storyCode":"OD-ST-3","avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st03.txt","sourceHash":"855fb89636595d468fef535b8e62387814d01245613e778d20ff5fd06f556e7e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"narration","text":"Half a month later"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you for all you've done, Cohen, Kötz, Tina, Alexsandr."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"On behalf of... The town of Long Spring..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, I'm not so good with this kind of formal language."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thanks to you, I survived the conflict with my brother, and my people were able to return to live on their land."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"We were only doing what had to be done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"We started this, so it's our responsibility to end it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"If it weren't for my irredeemable brother, none of this would've happened."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I would have liked to offer you a reward."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But, as you can see, our town has been destroyed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Anything we have left, I want used to rebuild Long Spring."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A cash reward... is beyond my power to give you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But anything you may want from this home is yours to take."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I think we will have to tear it all down and build a new Long Spring with the survivors."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"About that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Alexsandr?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"This helmet fits well. Can I keep it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh huh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Really, the nail tips are so blindingly bright, I'd like to put one on my shield so I don't need batteries anymore."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"That's enough for us. We're satisfied."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's... that's all?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"My weapons, my father's heirlooms, you can—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"No thanks. You need them more than we do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go. We should leave now."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mister Kötz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're finally done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you say goodbye to the Lord?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Then it's time for us to go too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"My team will cover your return to Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss Cohen, your squad is coming with us, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Right. We've been fighting too long. We need a place to rest and resupply."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"And most importantly, we probably need some identities."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Identities we can go around the world with... around Terra."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"The car's ready. We're off."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Human Resources Operator","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Your information has been registered with Rhodes Island. You may stay and resupply at Rhodes Island field offices, or safehouses across Terra."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Human Resources Operator","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Although you are not official employees of Rhodes Island, the mission network is open to you and you will be paid for contracts you complete."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Human Resources Operator","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"That's about it. Is there anything else you'd like to know?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Just real quick, I have to ask, does Rhodes Island have any sci-fi literature?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Human Resources Operator","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"So these are our new identities."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"At least I've got a shield I can use. Could be worse."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Do we have a plan?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Try to take a look at this world, which we now know too little about."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd like to have a detailed writeup myself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"But this time, I'm sorry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"It's all up to us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"So where's our first destination?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Somewhere called Siesta. Sounds like a pretty good city."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Then let's get going."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Until we make it back home, we're on the road."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Human Resources Operator"]},{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["Ash"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["Blitz"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["Frost"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["Tachanka"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["Rangers"]}]}
